y-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Researchers use the term "inflammaging" to describe how the body's inflammatory balance gets harder to maintain with age. As a powerful antioxidant, astaxanthin may help support a healthy inflammatory response and protect cells from everyday oxidative stress.</p></span></div><div data-rid="40996f0c-989b-422c-b58e-18b1a8fd87e4" class="r-u0pmh"><div data-rid="a07d7c52-172d-4a1f-a7cf-39481bb4e2dd" class="r-ptkoht"><div data-rid="7cb4b110-66b5-48c5-832c-bdacaa06c413" class="r-ganhez alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Inflammation Factor</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="bafc8af8-db0f-4a51-87ea-330707ea7779" class="r-1sgrlqk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Supporting a healthy inflammatory response</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-replo-component-root="carousel" data-replo-part="slide" data-replo-root-id="replo-carousel:Rdt3r2:" data-slide-index="2" data-slide-source-index="2" data-is-cloned="true" data-slide-id="replo-carousel:Rdt3r2::slide:2:2" id="replo-carousel:Rdt3r2::slide:2:2:R7dt3r2::clone:2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" role="group" aria-label="Slide 3" style="display:flex;height:100%;padding:0;margin:0;backface-visibility:hidden;flex-shrink:0;position:relative" data-component-id="a2e68d50-5265-4bf9-958d-b587d3026761" class="r-1tw9iji"><div data-rid="a2e68d50-5265-4bf9-958d-b587d3026761" class="r-162ivad"><picture data-rid="d061dfcb-ab45-4c3a-819f-0ac77cb23570" class="r-1yydvk4"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0667/1826/9574/files/card_3.png?v=1780242170&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0667/1826/9574/files/card_3.png?v=1780242170&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0667/1826/9574/files/card_3.png?v=1780242170&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0667/18